      "title": "CaseHoldsVersionsError gains its own UI error-state kind",
      "summary": "UiErrorStateKind and UI_STATE_BY_ERROR_CODE in error-ui-state.ts gain a case-holds-versions member so uiStateForApiError no longer folds CaseHoldsVersionsError into the generic fallback.",
      "task": "task/case-deletion-surface/case-holds-versions-error-state"
    },
    {
      "id": "implementation/case-deletion-surface/delete-case-mutation",
